z-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Antioxidants_and_Bioactive_Compounds" >抗氧化剂和生物活性化合物</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Other_Functional_Components_in_Fava_Beans" >蚕豆中的其他功能成分</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Low_Fat_High_Nutritional_Density" >低脂肪, 高营养密度</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#Why_Nutrition_Facts_Matter_to_Buyers" >为什么营养成分对买家很重要</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#Final_Thoughts_Nutrition_Is_Only_Valuable_When_Supply_Is_Reliable" >最后的想法: 只有供应可靠，营养才有价值</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#FAQ" >常问问题</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#1_Are_fava_beans_a_good_source_of_protein" >1. 蚕豆是蛋白质的良好来源吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#2_How_much_protein_is_in_fresh_vs_dried_fava_beans" >2. 新鲜蚕豆与干蚕豆的蛋白质含量是多少?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#3_Are_fava_beans_high_in_dietary_fiber" >3. 蚕豆膳食纤维含量高吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#4_What_vitamins_are_found_in_fava_beans" >4. 蚕豆中含有哪些维生素?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-17" href="#5_What_minerals_do_fava_beans_contain" >5. 蚕豆含有哪些矿物质?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-18" href="#6_Do_fava_beans_contain_antioxidants" >6. 蚕豆含有抗氧化剂吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-19" href="#7_Are_fava_beans_low_in_fat" >7. 蚕豆脂肪含量低吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-20" href="#8_Are_fava_beans_suitable_for_food_manufacturing_and_industrial_use" >8. 蚕豆适合食品制造和工业用途吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-21" href="#9_Do_fava_beans_contain_any_special_bioactive_compounds" >9. 蚕豆含有特殊的生物活性化合物吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-22" href="#10_Why_is_supplier_quality_important_when_evaluating_fava_beans_nutrition_facts" >10. 为什么在评估蚕豆营养成分时供应商质量很重要?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-23" href="#References" >参考</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="879" data-end="902"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Are_Fava_Beans"></span>什么是蚕豆?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="904" data-end="1216"><a href="/zh/dinweys-bulk-broad-bean-new-production/">蚕豆</a> (<em data-start="916" data-end="928">蚕豆</em>), 也称为蚕豆, 是世界上最古老的栽培豆类之一. 它们都被消耗为 <strong data-start="1039" data-end="1060">新鲜青豆</strong> 和 <strong data-start="1065" data-end="1087">干成熟豆子</strong>, 干蚕豆是食品制造中使用的主要形式, 植物蛋白加工, 和散装原料供应.</p><p data-start="1218" data-end="1304">从供应链的角度来看, <strong data-start="1250" data-end="1270">干蚕豆</strong> 受到青睐，因为他们提供:</p><ul data-start="1305" data-end="1404"><li data-start="1305" data-end="1339"><p data-start="1307" data-end="1339">营养成分稳定</p></li><li data-start="1340" data-end="1361"><p data-start="1342" data-end="1361">保质期更长</p></li><li data-start="1362" data-end="1404"><p data-start="1364" data-end="1404">每单位重量的蛋白质密度更高</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1406" data-end="1409" /><h2 data-start="1411" data-end="1451"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Fava_Beans_Nutrition_Facts_Per_100g"></span>蚕豆的营养成分 (每100克)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1453" data-end="1609">营养价值可能因品种和加工方式而略有不同, 但以下范围得到了分析数据和已发表研究的充分支持.</p><h3 data-start="1611" data-end="1630"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Protein_Content"></span>蛋白质含量<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1632" data-end="1673">蚕豆是一种 <strong data-start="1649" data-end="1672">高蛋白豆类</strong>:</p><ul data-start="1675" data-end="1892"><li data-start="1675" data-end="1822"><p data-start="1677" data-end="1822"><strong data-start="1677" data-end="1697">干蚕豆</strong>: 大约 <strong data-start="1713" data-end="1745">20每份 –25 克蛋白质 100 克</strong>, 一些品种接近 <strong data-start="1785" data-end="1822">30% 以干物质计的蛋白质</strong></p></li><li data-start="1823" data-end="1892"><p data-start="1825" data-end="1892"><strong data-start="1825" data-end="1845">新鲜蚕豆</strong>: 大约 <strong data-start="1861" data-end="1892">8每份 –10 克蛋白质 100 克</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start="1894" data-end="2056">根据我们向食品加工商供应蚕豆的经验, 这种蛋白质水平使它们成为极好的 <strong data-start="1998" data-end="2028">植物性蛋白质来源</strong>, 特别适合:</p><ul data-start="2057" data-end="2172"><li data-start="2057" data-end="2087"><p data-start="2059" data-end="2087">素食和纯素饮食</p></li><li data-start="2088" data-end="2135"><p data-start="2090" data-end="2135">谷物食品中的蛋白质强化</p></li><li data-start="2136" data-end="2172"><p data-start="2138" data-end="2172">替代蛋白质配方</p></li></ul><p data-start="2174" data-end="2339">科学研究证实蚕豆蛋白具有 <strong data-start="2230" data-end="2261">平衡的氨基酸谱</strong> 与许多其他豆类相比，消化率良好 (穆尔塔里等人。, 2015).</p><hr data-start="2341" data-end="2344" /><h3 data-start="2346" data-end="2363"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Dietary_Fiber"></span>膳食纤维<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2365" data-end="2411">蚕豆还富含 <strong data-start="2393" data-end="2410">膳食纤维</strong>:</p><ul data-start="2413" data-end="2452"><li data-start="2413" data-end="2452"><p data-start="2415" data-end="2452"><strong data-start="2415" data-end="2452">5每份 –11 克膳食纤维 100 克</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start="2454" data-end="2488">这种纤维含量有助于:</p><ul data-start="2489" data-end="2590"><li data-start="2489" data-end="2521"><p data-start="2491" data-end="2521">改善肠道蠕动</p></li><li data-start="2522" data-end="2547"><p data-start="2524" data-end="2547">降低胆固醇</p></li><li data-start="2548" data-end="2590"><p data-start="2550" data-end="2590">延长饱腹感并控制血糖</p></li></ul><p data-start="2592" data-end="2752">在商业食品应用中, 蚕豆等富含纤维的豆类经常用于 <strong data-start="2683" data-end="2703">功能性食品</strong> 旨在消化健康和体重管理.</p><hr data-start="2754" data-end="2757" /><h3 data-start="2759" data-end="2785"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Vitamins_in_Fava_Beans"></span>蚕豆的维生素<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2787" data-end="2880">蚕豆提供多种维生素, 特别 <strong data-start="2846" data-end="2868">B族维生素</strong>, 包括:</p><ul data-start="2882" data-end="3006"><li data-start="2882" data-end="2907"><p data-start="2884" data-end="2907">维生素B1 (硫胺素)</p></li><li data-start="2908" data-end="2935"><p data-start="2910" data-end="2935">维生素B2 (核黄素)</p></li><li data-start="2936" data-end="2950"><p data-start="2938" data-end="2950">维生素B6</p></li><li data-start="2951" data-end="2978"><p data-start="2953" data-end="2978"><strong data-start="2953" data-end="2976">叶酸 (维生素B9)</strong></p></li><li data-start="2979" data-end="2992"><p data-start="2981" data-end="2992">维生素C</p></li><li data-start="2993" data-end="3006"><p data-start="2995" data-end="3006">维生素K</p></li></ul><p data-start="3008" data-end="3263">叶酸值得特别关注: 它起着至关重要的作用 <strong data-start="3071" data-end="3138">DNA合成, 红细胞形成, 和神经发育</strong>, 使蚕豆对广大人群具有营养价值 (美国农业部, 由同行评审的营养数据支持).</p><hr data-start="3265" data-end="3268" /><h3 data-start="3270" data-end="3289"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Mineral_Profile"></span>矿物概况<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3291" data-end="3347">蚕豆含有多种必需矿物质, 例如:</p><ul data-start="3349" data-end="3680"><li data-start="3349" data-end="3387"><p data-start="3351" data-end="3387"><strong data-start="3351" data-end="3362">钙</strong> – 支持骨骼健康</p></li><li data-start="3388" data-end="3478"><p data-start="3390" data-end="3478"><strong data-start="3390" data-end="3398">铁</strong> – 对于血红蛋白合成和预防缺铁性贫血至关重要</p></li><li data-start="3479" data-end="3559"><p data-start="3481" data-end="3559"><strong data-start="3481" data-end="3494">钾</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_0" data-source="" data-orig="– helps maintain electrolyte balance and stable blood pressure">– helps maintain electrolyte balance and stable blood pressure</span></p></li><li data-start="3560" data-end="3629"><p data-start="3562" data-end="3629"><strong data-start="3562" data-end="3575">镁</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_1" data-source="" data-orig="– involved in energy metabolism and muscle function">– involved in energy metabolism and muscle function</span></p></li><li data-start="3630" data-end="3680"><p data-start="3632" data-end="3680"><strong data-start="3632" data-end="3640"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_2" data-source="" data-orig="Zinc">Zinc</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="– supports immune function and growth">– supports immune function and growth</span></p></li></ul><p data-start="3682" data-end="3878"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="From a supplier’s quality-control perspective">From a supplier’s quality-control perspective</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="mineral content stability is influenced by">mineral content stability is influenced by</span> <strong data-start="3772" data-end="3811"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="harvest maturity and drying methods">harvest maturity and drying methods</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="which is why standardized processing is critical for bulk supply">which is why standardized processing is critical for bulk supply</span>.</p><hr data-start="3880" data-end="3883" /><h2 data-start="3885" data-end="3924"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Antioxidants_and_Bioactive_Compounds"></span>抗氧化剂和生物活性化合物<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3926" data-end="4012"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="Beyond basic nutrition">Beyond basic nutrition</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="fava beans contain several">fava beans contain several</span> <strong data-start="3977" data-end="4000"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="bioactive compounds">bioactive compounds</span></strong>, 包括:</p><ul data-start="4014" data-end="4044"><li data-start="4014" data-end="4029"><p data-start="4016" data-end="4029"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="Polyphenols">Polyphenols</span></p></li><li data-start="4030" data-end="4044"><p data-start="4032" data-end="4044"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Flavonoids">Flavonoids</span></p></li></ul><p data-start="4046" data-end="4262"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="These compounds exhibit">These compounds exhibit</span> <strong data-start="4070" data-end="4094"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="antioxidant activity">antioxidant activity</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="helping to neutralize free radicals and potentially reduce the risk of chronic diseases such as cardiovascular disorders and metabolic syndrome">helping to neutralize free radicals and potentially reduce the risk of chronic diseases such as cardiovascular disorders and metabolic syndrome</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Boukid et al.">Boukid et al.</span>, 2019).</p><hr data-start="4264" data-end="4267" /><h2 data-start="4269" data-end="4313"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Other_Functional_Components_in_Fava_Beans"></span>蚕豆中的其他功能成分<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="4315" data-end="4377"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans also contain naturally occurring compounds such as">Fava beans also contain naturally occurring compounds such as</span>:</p><ul data-start="4379" data-end="4442"><li data-start="4379" data-end="4400"><p data-start="4381" data-end="4400"><strong data-start="4381" data-end="4398"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="Phospholipids">Phospholipids</span></strong></p></li><li data-start="4401" data-end="4416"><p data-start="4403" data-end="4416"><strong data-start="4403" data-end="4414"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="Choline">Choline</span></strong></p></li><li data-start="4417" data-end="4442"><p data-start="4419" data-end="4442"><strong data-start="4419" data-end="4440"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="L-DOPA">L-DOPA</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Levodopa">Levodopa</span>)</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start="4444" data-end="4718"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="L-DOPA is of particular scientific interest due to its role in">L-DOPA is of particular scientific interest due to its role in</span> <strong data-start="4507" data-end="4529"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="dopamine synthesis">dopamine synthesis</span></strong> 和神经功能. 虽然仅靠饮食摄入并不能起到治疗作用, 研究证实蚕豆是这种化合物最丰富的天然食物来源之一 (雷娜等人。, 2014).</p><hr data-start="4720" data-end="4723" /><h2 data-start="4725" data-end="4761"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Low_Fat_High_Nutritional_Density"></span>低脂肪, 高营养密度<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="4763" data-end="4850">蚕豆的另一个优点是 <strong data-start="4804" data-end="4823">低脂肪含量</strong>, 使它们适合:</p><ul data-start="4851" data-end="4908"><li data-start="4851" data-end="4868"><p data-start="4853" data-end="4868">低脂肪饮食</p></li><li data-start="4869" data-end="4908"><p data-start="4871" data-end="4908">以心脏健康为导向的食品</p></li></ul><p data-start="4910" data-end="5053">这个组合——<strong data-start="4927" data-end="4964">高蛋白, 高纤维, 低脂肪</strong>——这就是为什么蚕豆越来越多地用于 <strong data-start="5008" data-end="5052">植物基和清洁标签配方</strong>.</p><hr data-start="5055" data-end="5058" /><h2 data-start="5060" data-end="5099"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Why_Nutrition_Facts_Matter_to_Buyers"></span>为什么营养成分对买家很重要<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5101" data-end="5219">从我们作为蚕豆供应商的角色来看, 我们发现买家不太关心理论营养价值，而更关心:</p><ul data-start="5220" data-end="5347"><li data-start="5220" data-end="5250"><p data-start="5222" data-end="5250">批次间一致性</p></li><li data-start="5251" data-end="5283"><p data-start="5253" data-end="5283">干物质蛋白质稳定性</p></li><li data-start="5284" data-end="5347"><p data-start="5286" data-end="5347">加工适宜性 (铣削, 挤压, 发酵)</p></li></ul><p data-start="5349" data-end="5496">详细记录的营养成分使制造商能够配制具有以下成分的产品： <strong data-start="5428" data-end="5452">可预测的结果</strong>, 这对于扩大生产至关重要.</p><hr data-start="5498" data-end="5501" /><h2 data-start="5503" data-end="5572"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Final_Thoughts_Nutrition_Is_Only_Valuable_When_Supply_Is_Reliable"></span>最后的想法: 只有供应可靠，营养才有价值<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5574" data-end="5772">科学研究清楚地表明 <strong data-start="5613" data-end="5655">蚕豆营养丰富</strong>——富含蛋白质, 膳食纤维, 维生素, 矿物质, 和抗氧化化合物, 同时保持自然低脂肪.</p><p data-start="5774" data-end="5887">然而, 从供应商的角度, 这些营养成分只有在蚕豆被加工时才能转化为真正的价值:</p><ul data-start="5888" data-end="5965"><li data-start="5888" data-end="5910"><p data-start="5890" data-end="5910">适当收获</p></li><li data-start="5911" data-end="5930"><p data-start="5913" data-end="5930">仔细晾干</p></li><li data-start="5931" data-end="5965"><p data-start="5933" data-end="5965">一致分级和存储</p></li></ul><p data-start="5967" data-end="6042">这就是为什么营养数据和供应链专业知识必须齐头并进.</p><hr data-start="6044" data-end="6047" /><h2 data-start="46" data-end="67"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="FAQ"></span>常问问题<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="69" data-end="120"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Are_fava_beans_a_good_source_of_protein"></span><strong data-start="73" data-end="120">1. 蚕豆是蛋白质的良好来源吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="122" data-end="430">是的. 蚕豆被认为是 <strong data-start="155" data-end="178">高蛋白豆类</strong>. 干蚕豆通常含有 <strong data-start="215" data-end="247">20每份 –25 克蛋白质 100 克</strong>, 在某些品种中蛋白质含量可以接近 <strong data-start="300" data-end="329">30% 以干物质计</strong>. 这使它们成为极佳的植物蛋白来源, 特别适合素食和纯素饮食.</p><hr data-start="432" data-end="435" /><h3 data-start="437" data-end="497"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_How_much_protein_is_in_fresh_vs_dried_fava_beans"></span><strong data-start="441" data-end="497">2. 新鲜蚕豆与干蚕豆的蛋白质含量是多少?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="499" data-end="760">新鲜蚕豆通常含有 <strong data-start="532" data-end="563">8每份 –10 克蛋白质 100 克</strong>, 而干蚕豆则更加浓缩, 提供 <strong data-start="626" data-end="647">20–25 克/ 100 克</strong> 由于水分含量较低. 这就是为什么干蚕豆在食品制造和批量供应中受到青睐的原因.</p><hr data-start="762" data-end="765" /><h3 data-start="767" data-end="815"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Are_fava_beans_high_in_dietary_fiber"></span><strong data-start="771" data-end="815">3. 蚕豆膳食纤维含量高吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="817" data-end="1093">是的. 蚕豆大约含有 <strong data-start="855" data-end="892">5每份 –11 克膳食纤维 100 克</strong>, 支持消化健康, 有助于调节胆固醇水平, 并有助于产生饱腹感. 它们的纤维含量是它们被广泛用于功能性和健康食品的原因之一.</p><hr data-start="1095" data-end="1098" /><h3 data-start="1100" data-end="1149"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_What_vitamins_are_found_in_fava_beans"></span><strong data-start="1104" data-end="1149">4. 蚕豆中含有哪些维生素?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1151" data-end="1405">蚕豆富含 <strong data-start="1174" data-end="1196">B族维生素</strong>, 包括 <strong data-start="1208" data-end="1255">维生素B1, B2, B6, 和叶酸 (维生素B9)</strong>. 他们还提供 <strong data-start="1275" data-end="1302">维生素C和维生素K</strong>, 在新陈代谢中发挥重要作用, 红细胞形成, 免疫功能, 和骨骼健康.</p><hr data-start="1407" data-end="1410" /><h3 data-start="1412" data-end="1459"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_What_minerals_do_fava_beans_contain"></span><strong data-start="1416" data-end="1459">5. 蚕豆含有哪些矿物质?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1461" data-end="1712">蚕豆含有多种必需矿物质，例如 <strong data-start="1515" data-end="1576">钙, 铁, 钾, 镁, 磷, 和锌</strong>. 这些矿物质支持骨骼健康, 血液中的氧气运输, 电解质平衡, 免疫功能, 和整体代谢健康.</p><hr data-start="1714" data-end="1717" /><h3 data-start="1719" data-end="1765"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Do_fava_beans_contain_antioxidants"></span><strong data-start="1723" data-end="1765">6. 蚕豆含有抗氧化剂吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1767" data-end="1984">是的. 蚕豆含有 <strong data-start="1791" data-end="1821">多酚和类黄酮</strong>, 它们是抗氧化剂化合物，有助于中和自由基，并可能降低患慢性疾病的风险, 包括心血管和代谢疾病.</p><hr data-start="1986" data-end="1989" /><h3 data-start="1991" data-end="2028"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Are_fava_beans_low_in_fat"></span><strong data-start="1995" data-end="2028">7. 蚕豆脂肪含量低吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2030" data-end="2297">蚕豆是天然的 <strong data-start="2055" data-end="2069">脂肪含量低</strong>, 使它们适合低脂饮食和注重心脏健康的食品配方. 它们的营养成分结合了 <strong data-start="2189" data-end="2230">高蛋白, 高纤维, 和低脂肪</strong>, 这在植物性食品开发中特别有吸引力.</p><hr data-start="2299" data-end="2302" /><h3 data-start="2304" data-end="2381"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="8_Are_fava_beans_suitable_for_food_manufacturing_and_industrial_use"></span><strong data-start="2308" data-end="2381">8. 蚕豆适合食品制造和工业用途吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2383" data-end="2643">是的. 从供应商的角度来看, 干蚕豆广泛用于 <strong data-start="2455" data-end="2543">植物蛋白生产, 功能性食品, 零食, 和散装配料应用</strong> 由于其稳定的营养成分, 高蛋白质密度, 和良好的加工性能.</p><hr data-start="2645" data-end="2648" /><h3 data-start="2650" data-end="2715"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="9_Do_fava_beans_contain_any_special_bioactive_compounds"></span><strong data-start="2654" data-end="2715">9. 蚕豆含有特殊的生物活性化合物吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2717" data-end="2936">蚕豆天然含有以下化合物： <strong data-start="2764" data-end="2813">胆碱, 磷脂, 和左旋多巴 (左旋多巴)</strong>. L-DOPA 参与多巴胺合成，是蚕豆具有科学和营养价值的原因之一.</p><hr data-start="2938" data-end="2941" /><h3 data-start="2943" data-end="3032"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="10_Why_is_supplier_quality_important_when_evaluating_fava_beans_nutrition_facts"></span><strong data-start="2947" data-end="3032">10. 为什么在评估蚕豆营养成分时供应商质量很重要?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3034" data-end="3316">只有供应稳定时营养价值才可靠. 因素如 <strong data-start="3116" data-end="3193">收获成熟度, 干燥法, 湿度控制, 和储存条件</strong> 直接影响蛋白质, 纤维, 和矿物稳定性. 可靠的供应商确保批次之间的营养一致性.</p><hr /><h2 data-start="6049" data-end="6073"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span>参考<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="6075" data-end="6336">布基德, F。, 赞尼尼, E., 可爱的, E., &amp; 维塔迪尼, 乙. (2019). 豆类作为功能性成分: 加工对营养和功能特性影响的综述. <em data-start="6243" data-end="6284">食品科学趋势 &amp; 技术, 86</em>, 1–15.<br data-start="6291" data-end="6294" /><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tifs.2019.01.020" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6294" data-end="6336">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tifs.2019.01.020</a></p><p data-start="6338" data-end="6618">将被罚款, S。, 斯图尔特, D ., &amp; 拉塞尔, 瓦. 右. (2015). 蚕豆的潜力 (<em data-start="6413" data-end="6425">蚕豆</em>) 未来蛋白质供应将部分取代人类饮食中的肉类摄入量. <em data-start="6504" data-end="6563">食品科学与食品安全综合评价, 14</em>(5), 511–522.<br data-start="6576" data-end="6579" /><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" href="https://doi.org/10.1111/1541-4337.12146" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6579" data-end="6618">https://doi.org/10.1111/1541-4337.12146</a></p><p data-start="6620" data-end="6840">线, 一个. P。, 拉斯卡, 右. 一个。, &amp; 库尔希德, S. (2014). 不同蚕豆品种中左旋多巴的定量分析 (<em data-start="6735" data-end="6747">蚕豆</em> L。). <em data-start="6753" data-end="6795">食品科学与营养杂志, 2</em>(3), 89–95.<br data-start="6806" data-end="6809" /><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" href="https://doi.org/10.1002/fsn3.93" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6809" data-end="6840">https://doi.org/10.1002/fsn3.93</a></p>`} />
